    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Key Discontinuities: Conrad (Upper/Lower Crust), Mohorovičić (Crust/Mantle), Repetti (Upper/Lower Mantle), Gutenberg (Mantle/Core), and Lehmann (Outer/Inner Core).",
        "Shadow zones: P-wave shadow zone lies between 105° and 145°, while the S-wave shadow zone encompasses the entire region beyond 105°.",
        "Density gradient increases inward: Crust (~2.7–3.0 g/cm³), Mantle (~3.4–5.5 g/cm³), and Core (~13 g/cm³)."
      ],
      "id": "u9j2x47"
    },
    {
